        "original_id": "e102df7b-7a32-5b1f-ae6e-54f23bd776ad",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Jessica Jones, The Defenders\n- People: Melissa Rosenberg, Douglas Petrie, Marco Ramirez\n- Companies: Netflix, Marvel Comics\n- Systems: Marvel Cinematic Universe\n- Concepts: continuity, crossover miniseries, superhero team\n\nFacts:\n- Jessica Jones is an American web television series created for Netflix by Melissa Rosenberg and based on the Marvel Comics character Jessica Jones.\n- Jessica Jones is set in the Marvel Cinematic Universe and shares continuity with the franchise's films.\n- Jessica Jones is the second in a series of shows that lead to The Defenders crossover miniseries.\n- The Defenders is an American web television miniseries created for Netflix by Douglas Petrie and Marco Ramirez and based on the Marvel Comics characters Daredevil, Jessica Jones, Luke Cage, and Iron Fist.\n- In The Defenders, Daredevil, Jessica Jones, Luke Cage, and Iron Fist form the superhero team called the Defenders.",
